WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.920
I was built to crash. Six Rangers before me failed, so everyone held their breath.

2
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:17.700
For the last 17 minutes of my life my six cameras clicked as fast as they could.

3
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:26.950
I sent 4,308 pictures home, then I hit the Moon at about 2.6 km per second.

4
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:32.460
I was built to fall, and I took pictures all the way down.
